{"id": 90, "name": "Silvanna", "splash": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mobile-legends/images/9/97/Hero901-portrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20241021142831", "cls": ["Fighter", ""], "specialty": ["Initiator", "Magic Damage"], "difficulty": "20", "stats": ["50", "40", "70", "20"], "lanes": ["Exp Lane", ""], "story": "Princess of the Moniyan Empire and queen regent.", "skills": [{"name": "Knightess' Resolve", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_8a659e353c870bc077564afaaf4d8c2c.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}, {"tagid": 23, "tagname": "Debuff", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Silvanna's Basic Attacks deal 25<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+45% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#62f8fe\">(+75% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span>.\nSilvanna's attacks apply a mark on enemy heroes for 5s on hit, each mark reducing their Physical & Magic Defense by 3-6 (up to 5 stacks).\nSilvanna's skills and Basic Attacks deal 30% extra damage to enemy heroes with the max number of marks."}, {"name": "Cometic Lance", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_dbeca4aa319bdc1e24af7f53f6e6f8b9.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}, {"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 11   Mana Cost: 70", "desc": "Silvanna dashes forward. Upon reaching the max range or hitting a non-Minion enemy, she swings her lance, dealing 250<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+100% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to nearby enemies and stunning them for 1s."}, {"name": "Spiral Strangling", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_e72b0d82cfd40062ad9bb1485232b91f.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 52, "tagname": "Shield", "tagrgb": "89,168,111"}], "cdcost": "CD: 5   Mana Cost: 35", "desc": "Silvanna thrusts her lance in the target direction and spins it 6 times while gaining a 350<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+150% Total Magic Power)</span> shield. Each spin deals 165<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+45% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> and slightly pulls targets toward the center. Silvanna spins 1 additional time for every 50% of extra Attack Speed she possesses.\n\nThe skill deals only 50% damage against Minions.\n\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Spiral Strangling</span> counts as a Basic Attack but cannot Crit."}, {"name": "Imperial Justice", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_ef133226f4bc7ef8b815463980daa1a6.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 52   Mana Cost: 130", "desc": "Silvanna leaps to the target location and creates a Circle of Light upon landing, dealing 350<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+110% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to enemies in the area, slowing them by 40% for 1.5s, and restraining the closest enemy hero to the area for 3.5s. (This skill cannot be interrupted.)\n\nSilvanna gains 100% Attack Speed and 40% Lifesteal when in the Circle."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Arcane Boots", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_1a0d5709c23c25849cca889cb1303ecb.png"}, {"name": "Thunder Belt", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_efae63dc9b3da2bb48dbea60de7c79bc.png"}, {"name": "Genius Wand", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_5f615aa7cb949d4e43d24561b12ff0e1.png"}, {"name": "Concentrated Energy", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_0bf7aa2a2ab3f03a2f8ac3b9f37dd2d1.png"}, {"name": "Feather of Heaven", "icon": "https://a